# Hunspell affix file for the suggestion edit-sweep specs.
# Mirrors the shape the sweep depends on: a TRY string (substitution
# and insertion alphabet) and a productive -ly suffix (SFX Y) so that
# affixed forms like "definitely" are valid lookups without being
# dictionary stems.
SET UTF-8
TRY esianrtolcdugmphbyfvkwz

SFX Y Y 1
SFX Y 0 ly .
